      "source": "<span class=\"modifiers\">public class </span><span class=\"element-name type-name-label\">SimpleTypeInformationMapper</span>\n<span class=\"extends-implements\">extends <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>\nimplements <a href=\"TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">TypeInformationMapper</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanClassLoaderAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanClassLoaderAware</a></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"modifiers\">public class </span><span class=\"element-name type-name-label\">SimpleTypeInformationMapper</span>\n<span class=\"extends-implements\">extends <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>\nimplements <a href=\"TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">TypeInformationMapper</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanClassLoaderAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanClassLoaderAware</a></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> that shall be used when the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value is found as type hint.\nThe implementation will simply interpret the given value as fully-qualified class name and try to load the class.\nWill return null in case the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> is empty.",
      "translation": "返回在找到给定<a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>类型提示时应使用的<a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。\n实现将简单地解释给定的值作为完全限定的类名，并尝试加载该类。\n如果给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>为空，则返回 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Basic <a href=\"TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a> implementation that interprets the alias handles as fully qualified class name\nand tries to load a class with the given name to build <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. Returns the fully qualified class\nname for alias creation.",
      "translation": "一个基本的 `<a href=\"TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>` 实现，它将别名解释为完全限定类名，并尝试加载具有给定名称的类以构建 `<a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。返回用于创建别名的完全限定类名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> that shall be used when the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value is found as type hint.",
      "translation": "返回在找到给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"类或接口 in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 值作为类型提示时应使用的 <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
