    {
      "source": "Spring Data Core",
      "translation": "Spring Data 核心",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifier and Type",
      "translation": "修改类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Turn the given type information into the String representation that shall be stored.",
      "translation": "将给定的类型信息转换为应存储的字符串表示形式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Turn the given type information into the String representation that shall be stored. Default implementation simply\nreturns the fully-qualified class name.",
      "translation": "将给定的类型信息转换为应存储的字符串表示形式。默认实现直接返回完全限定的类名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#constructor-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Constructor Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#constructor-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Constructor Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\" tabindex=\"0\">SimpleTypeInformationMapper()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(int)\" tabindex=\"0\">SimpleTypeInformationMapper(int)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#resolveTypeFrom(org.springframework.data.mapping.Alias)\" tabindex=\"0\">resolveTypeFrom(Alias)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#createAliasFor(org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\" tabindex=\"0\">createAliasFor(TypeInformation)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#setBeanClassLoader(java.lang.ClassLoader)\" tabindex=\"0\">setBeanClassLoader(ClassLoader)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
